    "transcription": "原为华商纱布交易所。通和洋行设计，钢筋混凝土结构，1923年竣工。折衷的新古典主义风格。立面以腰线划分为三段，每段用壁柱上下对齐，呈垂直式。主入口开间略前出，顶部有山花装饰，两侧为爱奥尼式壁柱，由大台阶进入2层大厅。西部转角设穹顶塔楼。",
    "observed": "2020 gallery photos show the retained gold 上海自然博物馆 name above closed paired ornamental gates, a large split round central disc, two laurel medallions, front columns and a 260 address plaque. The street under the viaduct is partly obstructed. Photo 27 clearly identifies the open colonnaded circular drum with oculi and a domed crown."
  },
