    "old_spot_usage": "1921 exchange company established with an earlier rented site. The surviving building of Atkinson & Dallas was completed in 1923. Exhibition era opened at this address in 1958. Museum photographer Lu Jie recorded the May 2014 closure and subsequent move through October 2015. The new museum opened in 2015. The exchange stopped trading in August 1937."
